Java and GraalVM Native Image:

The JVM runtime uses the Java platform supplied by the user. Native builds use
GraalVM Community Edition and its Native Image substrate runtime under GPLv2
with the Classpath Exception. Linux native binaries dynamically link the host
system glibc (LGPL-2.1-or-later, minimum glibc 2.35); no glibc implementation
is statically linked or bundled.

